SCOPE NOTE — this licence covers the code, the project-generated analytical
tables in data/processed/, the manually compiled tables in data/manual/, the
figures in reports/figures/ and the written report.

It does NOT cover third-party source data. Those remain under their own terms
and are deliberately NOT redistributed here:

  - FIFA Post Match Summary Report PDFs (fifatrainingcentre.com) — fetched
    locally into data/raw/, gitignored, not committed.
  - SofaScore-derived momentum values, reached via the Ddey07 repository —
    proprietary index; used as a labelled secondary outcome only.
  - StatsBomb Open Data — see StatsBomb's own licence at
    https://github.com/statsbomb/open-data
  - mominullptr/FIFA-World-Cup-2026-Dataset — see that repository.

Anyone reproducing this work must obtain the upstream data themselves; the
scripts here will re-fetch or re-derive it. Provenance, commit hashes and
SHA-256 checksums for every input are recorded in config/sources.yaml and
data/processed/source_inventory.csv.
